      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REHAB VALUATOR CONCEPT CORPUS (concept reference, never local authority)\nscenario templates: by-right | build-to-rent | build-to-sell | multifamily | lot split | upzoning | land flip\ncalculator prompts: product/unit mix -> stabilized or sale value -> costs -> financing -> max land basis -> returns\nguards: entitlement upside is a hypothesis until official evidence + deterministic calculations support it",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "REHAB VALUATOR CONCEPT CORPUS (concept reference, never local authority)\nscenario templates: by-right | build-to-rent | build-to-sell | multifamily | lot split | upzoning | land flip\ncalculator prompts: product/unit mix -> stabilized or sale value -> costs -> financing -> max land basis -> returns\nguards: entitlement upside is a hypothesis until official evidence + deterministic calculations support it",
